      "created_at": "2025-04-22T07:18:10.976Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Sudh33r\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"145149\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/sudh33r/48/86028_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Sudh33r:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>redis-queue</code></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>In my case both containers are running.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/1/71241d439f33a3cbaa0e141feec4c65518305b8a.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/71241d439f33a3cbaa0e141feec4c65518305b8a\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/71241d439f33a3cbaa0e141feec4c65518305b8a_2_690x250.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"g8TknB6dDU2UOdaYQc8tBWFo48W\" width=\"690\" height=\"250\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/71241d439f33a3cbaa0e141feec4c65518305b8a_2_690x250.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/71241d439f33a3cbaa0e141feec4c65518305b8a_2_1035x375.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/1/71241d439f33a3cbaa0e141feec4c65518305b8a_2_1380x500.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"3E1B33\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1488×541 89.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
